                  <msItem>
                     <title>[Poem on Church Festivals]</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">BL Add. 38666 fol. 178 is a flyleaf bound up
                        with unrelated MSS.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Neither this flyleaf nor another one bearing
                        the name of St Cuthbert's Durham (fol. 4r) belonged originally to the book.
                        This leaf also has accounts of the weight and cost of the bells of St
                        Bride's Major, dioc. Llandaff, and of Merton College.</note>
                  </msItem>
